<h2>How to Get the Most From Any Under Desk Elliptical</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Stop the slide.</strong> Put a [[amazon:cubii-mat|non-slip mat]] under the machine and [[amazon:caster-cups|caster cups]] under a rolling chair.</li>
<li><strong>Start low.</strong> Use light resistance while you type and save higher resistance for calls and reading.</li>
<li><strong>Use intervals.</strong> Ten minutes of pedaling every half hour is easier to stick with than one long session. Our <a href="/tools/desk-pedal-timer/">desk pedal timer</a> will remind you.</li>
